## 4. Understanding Array Indexing

Input:

```java
nums = [1, 2, 1]
```

Original indexes:

| Index | Value |
|---:|---:|
| 0 | 1 |
| 1 | 2 |
| 2 | 1 |

New array indexes:

| Original index (i) | First half | Second half |
|---:|---:|---:|
| 0 | ans[0] | ans[3] |
| 1 | ans[1] | ans[4] |
| 2 | ans[2] | ans[5] |

### Important Formula

`Second half index = i + nums.length`

